{"unit": "family_z_melos_kphr_evidence_r3/adv/adv_11", "cond": "C", "split": "dev", "slug": "family_z_melos_kphr_evidence_r3", "level": "adv", "family": "Z", "parts": [{"part": "adv_11", "kind": "comment", "stratum": "gen", "sids": ["adv_11-s024", "adv_11-s025"]}], "ctx_sentences": 5, "ctx_chars": 164, "double_ctx_block": false, "ja": {"adv_11-s024": "メロスは戻ってくると約束し、友人は彼を信じることにした。", "adv_11-s025": "メロスが街へ戻る道を進む中で、何が起こるのでしょうか？"}, "complete": true, "paragraphs": 1, "paragraphs_translated": 1, "failures": [], "api_calls": {"translate": 1, "verify": 1}, "wall_s": 2.58, "cost_jpy": 0.0225, "calls": [{"kind": "translate", "wall_s": 1.61, "cost_jpy": 0.0133, "usage": {"input_tokens": 473, "output_tokens": 72, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0}}, {"kind": "verify", "wall_s": 0.97, "cost_jpy": 0.0092, "usage": {"input_tokens": 358, "output_tokens": 43, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 16}}]}
{"unit": "family_z_melos_kphr_evidence_r3/adv/adv_12", "cond": "C", "split": "dev", "slug": "family_z_melos_kphr_evidence_r3", "level": "adv", "family": "Z", "parts": [{"part": "adv_12", "kind": "story", "stratum": "gen", "sids": ["adv_12-s026", "adv_12-s027", "adv_12-s028", "adv_12-s029", "adv_12-s030", "adv_12-s031", "adv_12-s032", "adv_12-s033", "adv_12-s034", "adv_12-s035", "adv_12-s036", "adv_12-s037", "adv_12-s038", "adv_12-s039", "adv_12-s040", "adv_12-s041", "adv_12-s042"]}], "ctx_sentences": 5, "ctx_chars": 298, "double_ctx_block": false, "ja": {"adv_12-s026": "川に着くと、彼は立ち止まった。", "adv_12-s027": "橋はなくなっていた。", "adv_12-s028": "雨で水は茶色く濁り、荒れ狂っていた。", "adv_12-s029": "彼は後ずさりし、走って、濁流に身を投げた。", "adv_12-s030": "流れに引き込まれた。", "adv_12-s031": "彼は光に向かって必死にもがき、枝をつかんで、向こう岸によじ登った。", "adv_12-s032": "さらに進むと、3人の男が道をふさいでいた。", "adv_12-s033": "ナイフがきらりと光った。", "adv_12-s034": "メロスはそれを持つ男を杖で殴り、坂を駆け上がった。男たちの叫び声が後を追ってきた。", "adv_12-s035": "午後になると、一歩ごとに痛みが走った。", "adv_12-s036": "足は血で染まっていた。", "adv_12-s037": "彼は岩のそばに倒れ、起き上がろうとしたが、脚は言うことをきかなかった。", "adv_12-s038": "ここで待つこともできる。", "adv_12-s039": "誰かが見つけてくれるかもしれない。", "adv_12-s040": "家に帰ることもできる。", "adv_12-s041": "友は死んでしまう。", "adv_12-s042": "起き上がるより、そのほうが楽に思えた、恐ろしい一瞬だった。"}, "complete": true, "paragraphs": 1, "paragraphs_translated": 1, "failures": [], "api_calls": {"translate": 2, "verify": 1}, "wall_s": 23.43, "cost_jpy": 0.2256, "calls": [{"kind": "translate", "wall_s": 5.78, "cost_jpy": 0.0544, "usage": {"input_tokens": 663, "output_tokens": 547, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 137}}, {"kind": "translate", "wall_s": 4.99, "cost_jpy": 0.0493, "usage": {"input_tokens": 663, "output_tokens": 484, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 72}}, {"kind": "verify", "wall_s": 12.65, "cost_jpy": 0.1219, "usage": {"input_tokens": 835, "output_tokens": 1357, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 1210}}]}
{"unit": "family_z_melos_kphr_evidence_r3/adv/adv_13", "cond": "C", "split": "dev", "slug": "family_z_melos_kphr_evidence_r3", "level": "adv", "family": "Z", "parts": [{"part": "adv_13", "kind": "comment", "stratum": "gen", "sids": ["adv_13-s043", "adv_13-s044"]}], "ctx_sentences": 5, "ctx_chars": 213, "double_ctx_block": false, "ja": {"adv_13-s043": "メロスはひどいけがを負っており、一瞬、あきらめることを考える。", "adv_13-s044": "何が彼を進み続けさせるのか、そして彼は間に合うように街にたどり着けるのだろうか。"}, "complete": true, "paragraphs": 1, "paragraphs_translated": 1, "failures": [], "api_calls": {"translate": 1, "verify": 1}, "wall_s": 4.39, "cost_jpy": 0.0388, "calls": [{"kind": "translate", "wall_s": 3.04, "cost_jpy": 0.0268, "usage": {"input_tokens": 482, "output_tokens": 239, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 150}}, {"kind": "verify", "wall_s": 1.35, "cost_jpy": 0.012, "usage": {"input_tokens": 378, "output_tokens": 75, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 48}}]}
{"unit": "family_z_melos_kphr_evidence_r3/adv/adv_14", "cond": "C", "split": "dev", "slug": "family_z_melos_kphr_evidence_r3", "level": "adv", "family": "Z", "parts": [{"part": "adv_14", "kind": "story", "stratum": "gen", "sids": ["adv_14-s045", "adv_14-s046", "adv_14-s047", "adv_14-s048", "adv_14-s049", "adv_14-s050", "adv_14-s051", "adv_14-s052", "adv_14-s053", "adv_14-s054", "adv_14-s055", "adv_14-s056", "adv_14-s057", "adv_14-s058", "adv_14-s059", "adv_14-s060", "adv_14-s061", "adv_14-s062", "adv_14-s063", "adv_14-s064", "adv_14-s065", "adv_14-s066", "adv_14-s067", "adv_14-s068", "adv_14-s069"]}], "ctx_sentences": 3, "ctx_chars": 190, "double_ctx_block": true, "ja": {"adv_14-s045": "それから、鎖を受けるために差し出された手を思い出した。", "adv_14-s046": "友はもう一度約束するよう求めることなく、彼を信じていた。", "adv_14-s047": "岩の割れ目から水が滴っていた。", "adv_14-s048": "メロスは水を飲み、身を起こして膝をつき、立ち上がった。", "adv_14-s049": "一歩。", "adv_14-s050": "もう一歩。", "adv_14-s051": "市門で処刑の鐘が鳴った。", "adv_14-s052": "彼は広場に向かって走った。", "adv_14-s053": "友の頭上では、剣がすでに振り上げられていた。", "adv_14-s054": "「待て！", "adv_14-s055": "ここにいる！」", "adv_14-s056": "友は振り向いた。", "adv_14-s057": "メロスは友に倒れ込んだ。", "adv_14-s058": "「君を見捨てるところだった」", "adv_14-s059": "と彼はささやいた。", "adv_14-s060": "「もう信じるのをやめるところだった」", "adv_14-s061": "友は答えた。", "adv_14-s062": "最後の日差しが壁に触れるなか、彼らは抱き合った。", "adv_14-s063": "支配者は彼らをじっと見つめた。", "adv_14-s064": "「剣を下ろせ」", "adv_14-s065": "と彼はついに言った。", "adv_14-s066": "「二人とも解放しろ」", "adv_14-s067": "それから、もっと静かな声で彼は尋ねた。", "adv_14-s068": "「人はどうすれば、これほどの信頼を得られるのだろう？」", "adv_14-s069": "初めて、彼は答えを命じるのではなく、答えを待った。"}, "complete": true, "paragraphs": 13, "paragraphs_translated": 13, "failures": [], "api_calls": {"translate": 2, "verify": 1}, "wall_s": 19.65, "cost_jpy": 0.2107, "calls": [{"kind": "translate", "wall_s": 11.68, "cost_jpy": 0.1161, "usage": {"input_tokens": 671, "output_tokens": 1317, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 816}}, {"kind": "translate", "wall_s": 2.42, "cost_jpy": 0.0268, "usage": {"input_tokens": 868, "output_tokens": 161, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "r